<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">2 T'imotiwos</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 T'imotiwos</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 T'imotiwos Maants</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 T'im.</para>
  <para style="mt3">Wosheetso P'awlos Gitl Wosho</para>
  <para style="mt">T'imotiwos Maants</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">P'awlos T'imotiyossh b́ guut'ts gitl woshan, P'awlos karnon bín tep'fonat b́ fini tooho wottso jawetso T'imotiwossh b́ izts izo detske, bogshdek't b́ iztsonu k'amoon b́kup'ituwok'owe, T'imotiwos izonat bín b́ kup'at b́ datstsotse Iyesus Krstos jangosh amaneyarr b́gawish, doo shishiyosh keewets keewonat taare shintsatsi dano kup'ide'er deshr dab gondbek'onat k'efoon bíats bíayiyalor, daniyonat doo shisshiyo nabi finatse b́kup'ituwok'owe b́teshi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bítsnor T'imotiyos bíatsokorb́dek'etuwok'o bísh keewetso dogikok'o keewiru datsmec'ron moosheriu moshoke b́wokituwok'owe, man naari keewo k'ebiruwotsi t'afiyoniyere okoon k'osho b́k'alituwo deshatse.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jamanatse tuutson T'imotiwossh gawudek'o b́geyiyank'o teshtso P'awlos beyonat eegosh b́beyiruwok'o bítsnor b́ imnetiyo, b́k'amo, b́shuno, b́kup'onat b́gishewon bíats bodts gondbek'o bíkmankok'o b́shuutso b́shoyituwok'owa b́tesh.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">T'imotiwossh imets izo 1:3—2:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Jeen taana danatse eti aawo b́woor amanetso wotarr daatsewo 2:14—4:5</para>
  <para style="io1">Manoori teshst keewuwotsna et geyit bínjisheetuwots 4:6-18</para>
  <para style="io1">Gúúpo 4:19-22</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Iyesus Krstos weeron daatsets jangets kashi keewo keewetsok'on, Ik'o bí ettso Iyesus Krstossh wosheetso wottso P'awlosoke woshetsoniye.<verse eid="2TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Boree, shune na'o t naay T'imotiwossha, Niho Ik'oktsonat nodoonz Iyesus Krstosoki s'aatonat mhretiyo, jeenon neesh wotowe. <verse eid="2TI 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>T'uwe aawon uni'aawo neesh Ik'o t k'onor neen gawat t nihots bok'altsok'o taawere maac' s'ayinon bísh tfiniru Ik'o udirwe. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Ni aac'uwo bateratse, neen be'er ayide'er gene'uwosh neen bek'o tewunirwe. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Niyoke fa'a arik wotts imnetiyo gawiruwee, mannaari imnetiman shinowere ni'indo Loyidaanat ni'ind Ewunk'eyoke teshke, niyoknowere b́beyok'o t'iwintsree. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Man jangosh t kisho ni'ats t gedor neesh imetsonat niatsotse taawok'o wotat beyiru Ik' imtso aaniy n deshiyitwok'o neesh gawirwe. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Ik'o noosh b́ imiye angonat shunikon, b́ took keewi shayira bako shati shayiraliye.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Eshe nodoonz jango gawosh jitsk'aye, b́ jangosh tipetso taan jitsk'aye, ernmó Ik'o neesh b́'imet angon doo shishiy jangosh taanton gond bek'o de'e. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Bí noo nofints sheeng finosh b́woterawo b́ took shunon b́ s'aatone noon b́ kashiy, s'ayinoshowere noon s'eegree, s'aatanowere ay duroniyere shino Iyesus Krstosn noosh imre. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Deeranwere noon woritso Iyesus Krstosn b́ waatsotse and be'ere. Bí k'iri ango tiitst dooshishiyon k'ir desha dúre dúre beyo noosh b́k'iitsi.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Taawere doo shishiyan nabituwo, wosheetso, danifo wotat naashere. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Gond bek'anowere tiats b́bodir man jangoshe, eree koni ti'amantsk'o tdantsosh jitseratse, taash imets adar man aawu man b́ borfetso t kotetwok'o danre. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Tiyoke n shishts ar wotts aap'man ariyok'o woshde Iyesus Krstosn n detsts imnetiyonat shunon kore. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Neesh imets sheeng adarman noyitse beyiru Shayiri s'ayinon korde'e.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Isiya eteets datsatse beyiru jamwots taan k'az boamtsok'owo danfnee, hanotsisnwere Fegelosnat Hermogenesitse fa'ane. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Ik'o Onesifor meyitsi ashuwotssh mhretiyo ime, bíwere ayoto taan kup'shre, t tipetsatsnowere jitseratse. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Dab́ Romi eteets datsumadan b́ waatsok'on kup'dek' geeyat taan b́ daatsi, <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Dúr s'uwi aawu manotso Ik'o bísh mhretiyo ime, Efesonn t beemanor awuk'o taash b́ fintsok'o nee n tookon sheengsh dek'at danfnee.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Krstossh amanets kes's'tso wotar gond bek'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Eshe t naayo! Iyesus Krstosoke daatseyiru s'aatatson kup'owe. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Ay gawwots shinatse tiyooke n dants dano, koshwotsi daniyosh falitwotsnat amanets ashuwotssh adaro ime.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Neewere Iyesus Krstossh kes'ts sheengo wotarr taanton gond bek'o be'e. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Kes' kes'iru asho bín kes'omants azaziruman gene'ushosh k'an dek'tso woto bín geyituwe bako kes' fin woteraw finats jinatse. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Mank'o wos'on bogosh wos'iru asho b́ nemok'on nohewo b́ k'azal da'er dek'et akliliyo daatsratse. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Finon maawiru goshtso b́finiruwotse daatset shuwatse shin daatsetso dek'o bísh geyife. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Doonzo jam keewatse t'iwintsdek'o neesh b́ ímetuwotse taa neesh tíetirwo n nibotse gawude'ee.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>K'irotse tuuts Dawit naar wottso Iyesus Krstosi batk'aye, taawere t keewiru doo shishiyo maniye. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Doo shishiyan jangosh, gond fintsok'o muk'on tipeyat gondo t bek'iri, Ik' aap'onmó tiperatse. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Mansh boowere Iyesus Krstos weeron daatseyiru kashonat dúre dúri mangon bo daatsituwok'o, Ik'o boon marat'tswotssha er jam keewo taa k'amitwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Hank'o ett aap'man amaneke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">«Bínton no k'iriyal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">Bínton dab́ kashon nobetiye.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>K'amoon kup'ar nodatseyal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">Bínton naashituwone.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">Noo bín nohaaliyalmó bíwere noon haalitwe.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Noo amanetsuwotsi wotonok'azal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">Bímo b́tooko b́ haalerawotse jam aawo amanetso wotar beetuwe.»<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kup'at b́ fino fintso</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Keewan boosh gawiwe, aap'wots jangatse moosherawok'o Ik' shinatse boosh keewwe, aap'wotsn moshanuwere shishiru ashuwotsi b́ t'afiti bako egoshor woteratse. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Ari aap'man kááwon betsirwok'owonat b́ finon jitseraw fintso wotarr, Ik' shinatse n tooko n t'intsitwok'onat n keewre k'ebet asho nwotitwok'o k'aluwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Datsaatsikonat woteraw ooshiruwotsoke wokowe, man naari ooshiyo ashuwotsi iki bogshde'e Ik'atse bowokituwok'o b́woshiti, <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Bo noon keew keewonere kasheraw gawok'o boon b́ bodeti, boyitsnowere Hemenewosnat Filit'osn fa'ane. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Ashaanotswere «K'irotse tuwo yoots shin shin wotere» ett mosht aratse wokwtserne, ik ik ashuwots imnetiyonowere giwshirune. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Ernmó «Doonzo bík wottsuwotsi danfee,» eshe «Doonzo shúts s'eegiru jamo gondatse wokowa» eteets mahatebiyo bíatse fa'o giwraw Ik'i ned'okoniye kup'arniye b́ beeti.<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Een mootse awntsonat ambaron finets k'ac' mec'ro b́ woterawo mitonat shalon wozets k'ac'uwotswere daatsefnee, boowere ik ikuwots mang finosh ik ikuwots mang deshaw finats bojineti. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Mangosh woteraw keewanotsatse galeyat s'ayinon beyiru asho, mang finats jinet k'ac'ok'o wotituwe, sheeng finosh k'ants jamonat b́ doonzsh s'ayintsonat sheeng finats jinetwo wotituwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Jawetsori gond tewunatse wokowe, s'ayin nibon Ik' s'eegiru ashuwotsnton wotarr kááw finon, imnetiyon, shunon, jeeni jafrats sha'owe. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Fayeyo b́ dowetwok'o danr, daronot k'awnts desha mooshatse wokowe. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Doonzo Iyesussh guuts wottso, ash jamoke maac' nefo, daniyosh falituwonat k'amtso woto bín geyituwe bako fayeyo bín geyiratse. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Bín k'efiru ashuwotsi maac' nefon izitk woto bín geyife, daneraka bo ari keewo bo danal Ik'o danr boanituwok'o woshituwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Mank'owon bo nibo maantsan bo aaniyal Dablos shuno bok'alituwok'o boon b́ detsts kambotse keshutúnee.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Dúri s'uwi aawots wotit gond keewwotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Dúr s'uwi aawots kic'it aawo b́ weetuwok'o dande'e, <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Ashuwots bo tooko shuntso, gizosh k'awuntirwotsi, t'a'irwotsi, míshetswotsi, c'ashiruwotsi, ind nihosh alerawwotsi, boosh k'alere uderawotsi, S'ayin woterawotsi, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>Shun deshawwotsi, orowa erawwotsi, ash shútso t'afirwotsi, botook keewde'awwotsi, maac' kup'wotsi, sheeng wotts keewo shit'irwotsi, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>Ash beshide imetuwotsi boatso korde'awuwotsi bog taana etiru mishetswotsi, Ik' shunoniye bogshdek't bo meets gene'úwo shunetuwotsi wotitune. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Ik'o ik'iruwotsi arefetsrne bobe'eti, wotowa bako Ik' ik'iy angonmó bohaaliti, hanotsk'o ashuwotsatse wokowe. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Hank'o ashmanots maa mootse mut'aarr kindfets morro boats b́ dakere k'osh k'osh tewunon sha'iru, kash weratse maawk wotts máátsuwotsi widon detset ashuwotsiye. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Mannaari máátsuwotsu jam aawe bo daniri, erenmó arik wotts danook bodosh falratsne. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Iyanesnat Iyanberesn Museyi bo k'eftsok'o ashaanots bo tokoono awaashtswotsnat bo imnetiyon diho boats b́ bodtsotse ari keewo k'efe bok'efiriye. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Iyanesnat Iyanberesn dark bowoto b́ be'etsok'o ashaanots dark bowotonuwe ash jami shinatse b́ be'etuwosh boosh kááweratse.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gond durmansh wotit izo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Neemó t daniyo, t beyo, t jangirwo, t imnetiyo, t k'amo, t shuno, t detsats t kup'tsok'o neewere tijafarats sha'erne, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>Mank'owere t gishewonat tkic'o danfnee, Ans'okiyanat Ik'oniyonn Lst'ronnowere ti'ats bodts keewonat k'amoon t dek'ts gishewonowere danfnee, doonzonmó jamotse taan b́ faryi. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Iyesus Krstos jir wotar shayri beyon beyosh geyiru jamwotsats gishewo bodetuwe. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Ernmó gond ashuwotsnat ariyirwotsmó ash ashuwotsno darifetsŕ bo tokishowere shelfetsr, gondats gondo dabfera boameti, <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Neemó konok danndek'tsok'o ndantsotse, n dantsotsok'onat ariko t'iwints ndek'tsatso kup'arr ned'owee. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Manshowere n na'ortson dek'at n tuutso Iyesus Krstosi amanon daatset kasho b́ daatset danitelefo dano neesh imet s'ayin mas'aafwotsi danrnee. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>S'ayin mas'aaf jamo Ik'i shayiri S'ayinon jisheyat guut'eke, bíwere ariko daniyosh, sheeltswotsi fayosh, daronowere káátsootsnat kááwu beyoshowere k'antsomants jishituwo imosh t'ak'amitke. <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>Ik' asho s'ayin bowotituwok'onat jam keewu sheeng fino finosh falr b́ beetuewk'o betsoshe.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Ik'onat b́ mangsto b́ need'iwor kashon beyiruwotsnat k'irtsuwotsats angshituwo b́be'eoon Iyesus shinatse oona neen k'oniruwe, <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Bí aap'ono naabúwee, b́ k'anoroo, k'ano b́ k'azoro jam aawo kup'de'er finowe, danifetsr, hadefetsr, izfetsr, k'amefetsr daniyon kup'owe. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Ashuwotssh kash daatsit danman shishosh geyo bok'azet aawo weetuwe, ernmó worewosh mirac'ar bo botookon boshunts keewo boosh keewr daniyituwotsi ko'idek'etunee. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Mansh ariko k'ebo k'ayr turur k'ebo shunetunee. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Neemó jam keewatse ni'atso korde, gond bek'orowere k'amdek'on kup'owe, doo shishiyo nabi keewono fin ishuwe, ni fin jamono s'eentswe.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Taayelee shukewosh t'iiniruwe, datsanatse tuur tiamet aawo bodre, <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Kes'onere sheengsh dek'at kes'ree, wos'onowere nohewon b́ s'uufetsosh wos'ree, t imnetiyono kotre. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Eshe haniyak kááwi akliliyo taash k'anatniye taan b́ kotiri, aklilymanowere kááw angshiru doonzman manots taash imetuwe, b́ imetuwere t s'uzsh b́woterawo b́ be'ewo shuniru jamwotsshe.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">B́ took tooki kis'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Káári tiyok nweetwok'o wotowe, <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Demas datsani shunt tiatse k'alewtsere, Teselonk'e maantsowere k'azamree, K'erk'is Gelatiy maants, Titowere Dlmat'i eteets datsomants amree. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Taanton fa'o Luk'as s'uziye, Mark'os Ik'i finosh taash b́dabish geede'er wowe. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Tikik'osi Efeson maants woshk'rere. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Nwoor T'iro'ad datsatse Karpusokee k'aztwaats kaaboo taash de'ewowe, b́ mas'aafwotsi bítsnor Branikuwotsi taash de'ewowe. <verse eid="2TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>K'aaz k'is'fo Eskndr ayidek'tniye tiats gondo b́ betsi, doonzo b́ finok'o bísh dashetwe. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Bí noo nok'alirwo kup'sh dek't b́ k'efiruwotse neewor ntokish bí'atse n tooko korde'e.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Boon s'amiyets keewatse shino moosho dek'at tt'iintstsok'on jametsuwots tiatsna k'az bok'aleyi bako taanton wotdek't mooshtso konuwor aaliye b́teshi, keewmanor Ik'o naandok'o woshde boats taawk'aye. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Ernmó woshman t weeron s'eenon keeweyarr Ik' danaw ash jamó b́o k'ebetuwok'o doonzo taanton wotat́ taan kup'shre, Eeshi noonotsnowere taan ooriree. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Doonzo taan gond keew jamotse farire, darotse fa'o b́ mengstosh taan betsituwe, dúre dúron mango bísh wotowa! Amen.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwori jamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>P'rsk'lonat Ak'ilnsh, Onesiforum maa ashuwotssh t jamó t'intsuwe. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Erast'ros K'orontositse ooruwtsere, Profimos shodt Milit'itse k'azwaaree. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Joosho b́ kindfetsere tiyok nweetwok'o wotowe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ewubulos, P'udes, Linos, K'lawiyanat amants jamwotswor jamo neesh t'intsirune.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Doonzo it shayironton wotowe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Ik'i s'aato itnton wotowe.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
